<title>USA: Storm gains strength as tracks towards Philippines.</title>
<headline>Storm gains strength as tracks towards Philippines.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Beth, strengthening in the Philippine Sea, is expected to become a typhoon before it hits northeastern Luzon in the Philippines in 36-40 hours, private forecaster Weather Services Corporation (WSC) said.</p>
<p>Top winds are expected to reach 75 mph.</p>
<p>Wind damage, flooding and mudslides are expected.</p>
</text>
